          "date": "2026-08-10T20:08:57.000Z",
          "title": "Queen Bee",
          "summary": "Hello everyone, I'm here to welcome a new boss, new weapon, and a minor fix to the alchemy table (long-awaited...)",
          "version": "1.2.10",
          "kind": "patch",
          "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/3629280/view/1840310314352466"
        },
        {
          "id": "steam-1839676055887096",
          "date": "2026-07-31T04:34:12.000Z",
          "title": "Announcing Kingdom TD: Draft Your Demise — My New Tower Defense Game",
          "summary": "Hi everyone! I'm excited to finally share the new project I've been working on: Kingdom TD: Draft Your Demise, a fantasy tower defense game where you choose the enemies you'll have to survive against in battle.",
          "kind": "news",
          "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/3629280/view/1839676055887096"
        },
        {
          "id": "steam-1837955055361712",
          "date": "2026-07-12T19:25:41.000Z",
          "title": "Patch notes",
          "summary": "Alchemy table placement should be stricter, no more OOB Endless level cap is now visible in pause menu (under Pause)",
          "version": "1.2.9",
          "kind": "patch",
          "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/3629280/view/1837955055361712"
        },
        {
          "id": "steam-1836506165559377",
          "date": "2026-06-29T06:31:05.000Z",
          "title": "Patch notes",
          "summary": "Fixed music issue with Beach Endless map Fixed issue with boss spawning in Village Endless",
          "version": "1.2.8",
          "kind": "patch",
          "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/3629280/view/1836506165559377"
        },
        {
          "id": "steam-1836506165555968",
          "date": "2026-06-27T07:21:10.000Z",
          "title": "Damage Summary + Weapons Menu Update!",
          "summary": "This update is all about knowing your numbers. The Damage Summary has been rebuilt to track everything your run is doing independently — not just raw weapon hits — and the Weapons menu shows off the abilities and upgrades you've collected…",
          "version": "1.2.7",
          "kind": "patch",
          "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/3629280/view/1836506165555968"
        }
      ]
